  "context": [
    "Ongoing: Vent path sizing and cell spacing to contain a single-cell runaway",
    "Ongoing: FOC rewrite with a thermal model and derating for DVT actuators. This week: Compromise: derate ramps over 2 s and publishes a warning to the controller.",
